Host section structure
The ﬁrst line consists of keywords identifying the load indices that you wish to conﬁgure on a per-host basis. The keyword HOST_NAME must be used;
the others are optional.

If you use an older version of bjobs, the pending reason is:
Unknown pending reason code <6701>;
The parameter is deﬁned in lsb.params, lsb.queues (overrides lsb.params), and lsb.applications (overrides both lsb.params and lsb.queues).

